Package: appchecker
Version: 0.3.0-1
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 12000
Depends: git, libdbus-1-3, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libxcb1, libx11-6, libgl1
Maintainer: ronylicha <ronylicha@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Native Linux desktop and terminal dependency monitor
 AppChecker monitors local development projects with real-time Git status,
 dependency update tracking across npm/Cargo/pip/Go/Composer/Gem ecosystems,
 and severity-based desktop notifications via D-Bus.
 .
 Features:
 - Native desktop interface with mouse and keyboard navigation
 - Selective, per-project, and global dependency updates with safe backups
 - Optional reviewed AI remediation through official Claude Code, Codex, and Antigravity CLIs
 - Automatic project discovery and local Git status scanning
 - Registry update checks for six package ecosystems
 - Desktop notifications with quiet hours and batching
 - Air-gap mode for corporate/offline environments
 - Reactive filesystem watching and SQLite-backed persistence
Homepage: https://github.com/ronylicha/appchecker
